OL,3,AMargaret Hamilton, whose software
OL,4,Ahelped land Apollo 11 on the Moon, dies
OL,5,Aat 90
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe computer scientist behind
OL,8,Fgroundbreaking research that helped
OL,9,Fland Nasa's astronauts on the Moon, has
OL,10,Fdied aged 90.
OL,12,FMargaret Hamilton was a trailblazer in
OL,13,Fher field, leading the team who
OL,14,Fdeveloped the software for Nasa's
OL,15,FApollo missions, which coined the term
OL,16,F"software engineering".
OL,18,FHamilton's former employer, the
OL,19,FMassachusetts Institute of Technology
OL,20,F(MIT), confirmed her death, adding she
OL,21,Fdied on 30 September.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
